# Audited: 6, Double (Double 3) = 12 and Circle 3 at the build; Work's entry and its two calls of Grow through Twice are the three cycles, and Grow (Grow 3) = 5.
# The function values' tests: declarations of be-function-values.prism (Semantics chapter 6).

test functions_cross_the_boundary, @Shown 3:
    build
        => expect Ui.Label(text="6 12 Circle 3")
    compute until idle
        => expect Ui.Label(text="6 12 Circle 3 5")
